Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:08:00.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之八爪女》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可没说戒备会这么森严 - 他们把下午班机提早到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't say there'd be such security. - They moved the flight forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是得按计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to go ahead as planned anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,托洛？听来好像蛮牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toro? Sounds like a load of bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界可真小 你也叫托洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, small world. You're a Toro, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈阿密见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（燃料不足）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请加满油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:31.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:46.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国大使官邸）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大使 宾客都到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guests have arrived, Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 该去迎宾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越来越漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You become more beautiful every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在这里 - 当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm over here. - Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的新助理 潘娜普斯摩本小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Miss Penelope Smallbone, my new assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯摩本小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Smallbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 我能说什么… 除了她又漂亮又迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say, Moneypenny? Except that she is as attractive and as charming…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我从前一样？- 我可没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As I used to be? - I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你真会奉承\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a flatterer, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:14:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 你也知道 从来没有人…以后也没人能像你这样吸引我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, you know there never has been and never will be anybody but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎加入环球出口公司 - 收下吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome to Universal Exports. - Take it, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是你唯一能从他身上得到的 - 谢谢 邦德指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all you'll ever get from him. - Thank you, Commander Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识我？- 钱班霓小姐形容过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know me? - Miss Moneypenny described you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细到令人厌恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}In nauseating detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很适合在这工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you're going to fit in here very nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 007 - 早安 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, 007. - Morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 部长 - 指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Minister. - Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该认识吉姆芬宁 我们的艺术品专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know Jim Fanning, our art expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 你好 吉姆 - 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Hello, Jim. - James.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道这是什么？- 看来像法贝燮的珠宝蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know what this is? - It looks like a Faberg?egg, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔法贝燮制作的珠宝蛋之一 当作俄国皇室的复活节礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the jewelled eggs by Carl Faberg as a gift for the Russian royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.58,0:14:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,价值连城而且相当稀少\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're priceless and very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个里面有座 皇家马车的模型\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one contains a model of the imperial state coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.59,0:14:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叙述的真详细 007 - 谢谢你 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Top marks, 007. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过这是膺品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except it's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个才是真品 今天下午将在苏富比拍卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the real thing. It's being auctioned at Sotheby's this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是今年拍卖的第四个珠宝蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the fourth egg to turn up at auction this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是经由正常管道 匿名的卖主 秘密瑞士银行帐户\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from none of the usual sources. Anonymous seller, Swiss bank account.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说卖主是俄国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that the vendor was a Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个变成为…几可乱真的膺品\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now this turns up. A near-perfect forgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为邦德应陪你去拍卖会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Commander Bond should accompany you to the sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我正需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid. I could use an extra pair of eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们能找出卖主是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could try and spot the seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们通常都表现得毫无兴趣 或是趁机哄抬物价\N{\fnArial\fs30}They usually turn up out of interest or perhaps just to bump up the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 芬宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Fanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果俄国人是卖主 有可能是筹措财源\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is the Russians, it may be an effort to raise currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为海外间谍活动提供经费 或是偿还债务\N{\fnArial\fs30}for covert operations abroad or for payoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我们最好查明他们的企图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we'd better find out what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 部长 - 007 机密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Minister. - Eyes only, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝物行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Trove.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你取代009进行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be replacing 009.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:16:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在东德因公殉职 手中还握着那个珠宝蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned up dead in East Germany with that egg in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕没进一步的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not much to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长 还有一条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we do have one lead, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一位女士的收藏」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Property of a Lady."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一项议题是…与北约组织的双边限武谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next on the agenda is the continuing mutual disarmament talks with NATO.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们都看过戈格将军的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you've all read General Gogol's report.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,内容似乎非常详尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 主席同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Comrade Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我已表达给在座各位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I express the opinion of everyone present.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,采纳北约组织的建议 并不会危害我们的国防体系\N{\fnArial\fs30}that adoption of NATO proposals does not compromise our defensive position.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主席同志 - 奥洛夫将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Comrade Chairman. - General Orlov.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈格将军太放肆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Gogol is presumptuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只代表自己…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He speaks for himself and others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,及其他贪生怕死的人发言 落伍且不切实际的政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}who cling to timid, outdated and unrealistic policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道要我提醒各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must I remind you, the committee,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在决定限武谈判之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our overwhelming superiority over NATO forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对北约组织有绝对的优势？\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we give it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在东德地区所指挥的部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}In East Germany under my direct command,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.31,0:17:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,共有31个师的兵力 包括11个装甲师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have 31 divisions, including 11 tank divisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.15,0:17:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,捷克另有五个装甲师\N{\fnArial\fs30}and another five in Czechoslovakia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,支援西部边境的还有六十个师\N{\fnArial\fs30}In support, on the Russian western border are 60 divisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括22个装甲师\N{\fnArial\fs30}including 22 tank divisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,总言之 我军的优势是十比一\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all, a 10-1 advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国与西德军方顶多…只能动员十个装甲师\N{\fnArial\fs30}American and West German forces can field at most ten armoured divisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国只维持象征性的兵力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British maintain only a token force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们运用最新型的科索夫电脑 已进行多次进攻战略沙盘推演\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have played out a variety of attack strategies on the new Kutuzov computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,结论就是以十个装甲师…由北方发动闪电攻势\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find that a lightning thrust by ten armoured divisions from the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上五个装甲师取道捷克 面对任何可能遭遇的防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by five more through Czechoslovakia, lead to total victory in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我军五天便可获致全面胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}against any possible defence scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直太疯狂了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is absolute madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道这么做的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know where it will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,北约组织会以核武反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}NATO will counterattack with nuclear weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方世界是颓废分化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The West is decadent and divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不敢冒我方核子报复的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has no stomach to risk our atomic reprisals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个欧洲地区 每天都有人示威 要求片面核武限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throughout Europe, daily demonstrations demand unilateral nuclear disarmament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不出为何要甘冒战争危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see no reason to risk war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来满足你个人的偏执狂 以及征服他人的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to satisfy your personal paranoia and thirst for conquest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须先解决国内迫切的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must turn our energies to pressing domestic problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈格将军 让我提醒你 - 同志们 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- General Gogol, let me remind you… - Comrades, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要告诉你… - 你们两个都坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish to tell you… - Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球社会主义的目标要和平达成\N{\fnArial\fs30}World socialism will be achieved peaceably.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的军事角色是防卫性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our military role is strictly defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥洛夫将军 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that understood, General Orlov?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈格将军 请继续？\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Gogol, would you continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 主席同志 接下来… 我要说明我的报告重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Comrade Chairman. I will now turn to the specifics of my report…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我会尽快赶去 是 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I will be there as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:38.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克里姆林宫艺术品收藏库）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正试着专心 - 蓝金！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am trying to concentrate. - Lenkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底什么事？- 坏消息 将军同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - It's terrible news, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:20:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,复制品在运送途中遭窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reproduction has been stolen in transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃贼已消灭 但珠宝蛋遗失河中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thief was dealt with, but the egg was lost in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.73,0:20:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的无能会害死大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your incompetence will destroy us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们再制作一个 - 没时间了 将军同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll have a replacement made. - There is no time, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚接获通知 两天后就要不定期盘点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just been informed of an unscheduled inventory in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝金 克制点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会通知伦敦的人员 一定要拿回真品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell our London people we must have the genuine egg back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能及时联络上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we can reach them in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,布索尼得标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold to Busoni.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一件是48号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next lot is number 48.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,名匠卡尔法贝燮为皇室制作的 纯金复活节珠宝蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A superb green-gold lmperial Easter egg by Carl Faberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,透明绿的珐琅 用金打造的月桂冠叶片围绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enamelled in translucent green, enclosed by gold laurel-leaf trellis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,点缀蓝宝石及镶钻的纯金四色堇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set with blue sapphires and four petalled gold flowers with diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 价值多少？- 25万至30万英镑 再高的话就疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much should it fetch? - 50-300, 000. Anything more'd be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国沙皇尼古拉斯 1897年在莫斯科曾使用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…used by Tsar Nicholas in 1897 in Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一位女士的收藏」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Property of a Lady."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里女士可真不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are quite a few ladies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不需要亲自来 可以委托代理人出面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't have to be here in person. She could be represented by proxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,底价15万英镑开始出价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start it at 50, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,15万 16万\N{\fnArial\fs30}150, 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,17万？17万\N{\fnArial\fs30}170. 170.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,18万 19万\N{\fnArial\fs30}180, 190.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,20万 女士 出价高过你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}200. Against you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有人要出价吗？- 那边有位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any more? - Now there is a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,22万\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,24万英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}240.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,多注意拍卖状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, stick to the business in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,26万\N{\fnArial\fs30}60, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,28万英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}280000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.16,0:21:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,30万英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}300, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来加价以两万镑为单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And 20?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.59,0:21:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你要出价吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you bidding, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.17,0:22:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,32万镑 新的出价人\N{\fnArial\fs30}320, 000. New bidder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可真是有趣 - 你认识他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's interesting. - You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马汗 通常是卖主身分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamal Khan. Usually a seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来历不明的素质 勉强跻身上流人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marginal quality from dubious sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.94,0:22:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,38万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}380, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中间的男士出价40万镑 - 应该可以成交了 还有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 400 in the centre. - Well, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡马汗出了最高价 - 先生 你出价40万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kamal has gone over the top. - Your bid, sir. 400, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,40万镑 还有人出价吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}400, 000. Any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,42万5千镑 新出价者\N{\fnArial\fs30}425. New bidder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.79,0:22:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 42万5千镑 - 你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 425. - Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他到底多想买它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how badly he wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,45万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}450?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,45万镑 有人出47万5千镑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}450. 475?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前出价是45万镑 有人出47万5千镑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bid is 450. 475?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 有人出价比你高 有人比45万镑高吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against you, sir. No more than 450.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆？- 目前出价是45万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jim? - The bid is?50, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人出价47万5千镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have 475.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,50万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}500, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人出价50万镑 还有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have half a million pounds. All done?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人出价吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 成交 50万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours, sir, for 500, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下一件是49号 - 你差点就要掏腰包买下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The next lot is… - We could have been stuck with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很怀疑 他势在必得 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I doubt it. He had to buy it. - But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要追查的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I intend to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权出价买那个珠宝蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had no business bidding for that egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.89,0:24:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你真的出价成功该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have done if you'd got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会声称那是膺品并拒绝付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have claimed it was a fake, sir, and not paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝付钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真品在我手上 我在拍卖会上调了包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the original. I switched it with the fake during the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.99,0:24:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.83,0:24:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一买主发现怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens when the buyer discovers that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他是正当的话 他会提出申诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he complains. If he's legitimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.92,0:24:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此话怎讲？- 我认为他不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - I don't think he will complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.17,0:24:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬宁表示卡马汗通常是卖主身分 但是现在他成为买主\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Fanning, this Kamal usually sells. Now he buys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,膺品会令他原形毕露\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that the fake will smoke him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.93,0:24:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我方人员跟踪他到希斯罗机场 他搭机前往新德里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our tail followed him to Heathrow where he caught a plane to Delhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:24:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must go there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.60,0:25:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会通知沙鲁丁继续监视他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll alert Sadruddin, our man in Station I, to keep him under surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.19,0:25:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搭下一班飞机去 - 飞机还有55分钟就要起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Book yourself on the next flight out. - Well, I've 55 minutes to catch it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.94,0:25:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德 - 是 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Bond? - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.28,0:25:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开前先签一张珠宝蛋的放行条 它现在是政府财产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign a chit for that egg before you go. It's government property now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.94,0:26:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这首曲子真不错 你收英镑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming tune. You do take English money?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.02,0:26:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只收一镑的金币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only gold sovereigns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.28,0:26:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.28,0:26:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫维杰 环球出口公司特别督导员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Vijay. Special expediter, Universal Exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.45,0:26:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎来印度 邦德指挥官 - 谢谢 叫我詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome to India, Commander Bond. - Call me James.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.37,0:26:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沙鲁丁在哪里？- 这边请 他在计程车中等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Sadruddin? - Waiting in the taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.71,0:26:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种乔装法大错特错 我讨厌蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the wrong cover. I hate snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.88,0:26:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi. Please be comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.30,0:26:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是沙鲁丁 地区小队长 - 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am Sadruddin, Head of Section. - How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.72,0:26:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已在新尼瓦斯饭店订好房间 - 很好 行李呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I booked you in at the Shivnivas Hotel. - Good. My luggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.89,0:27:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,先送去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.31,0:27:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我关于卡马汗的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you tell me about Kamal Khan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.90,0:27:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭放逐的阿富汗王子 运动家 马球 板球 网球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exiled Afghan prince. Sportsman, polo, cricket, tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.07,0:27:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也会玩一点网球 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I play a bit myself. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.07,0:27:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上… 我在他的俱乐部兼任职业选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, I've got a part-time job as a pro at Kamal's club.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.66,0:27:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你学到了些什么？- 我的反手拍进步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you learned so far? - My backhand's improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.08,0:27:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马汗的豪宅就在山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamal lives there on the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.25,0:27:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,季风皇宫 那里戒备森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Monsoon Palace. It's heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.01,0:27:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要如何才能找到他？- 几乎每天下午与晚上…他都在饭店赌场内玩双陆棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do I get to him? - He plays backgammon at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.26,0:27:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为饭店房客 你自然就是会员\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a guest, you're automatically a member.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.10,0:27:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们何不晚一点在那里碰面？- 我去换件轻便的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's meet there later. - I'll change into something less casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.10,0:27:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去 你玩蛇时可能需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you may need this to play with your asp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.70,0:28:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 我是邦德 我已订好房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Name's Bond. I believe you have a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.04,0:28:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本饭店正等你大驾光临 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've been expecting you. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.29,0:28:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你在此玩得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you have a pleasant stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.96,0:28:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.97,0:28:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.64,0:28:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行李已整理好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your luggage has been unpacked, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.31,0:28:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 谢谢 - 假如还有需要我服务之处…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, thank you. - If I can be of further assistance…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.31,0:28:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有任何需要吗？- 或许晚一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything at all? - Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.29,0:29:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他玩的如何？- 上校也不是生手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's he doing? - The Major's no novice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.87,0:29:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是卡马汗已赢了他二十万卢比 - 这你可赢不了了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But Kamal has won 200, 000 rupees. - You'll have a job beating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天手气很好 要加倍吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel lucky. Shall we double?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.30,0:29:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.47,0:29:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,两万卢比\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 000 rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.39,0:29:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每次你要的时候都出豹子 - 一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Always a double six when you need it. - Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.90,0:29:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么办到的？- 全凭手腕功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you do it. - It's all in the wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.82,0:30:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就办不到 - 上校 相同赌注再玩一局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's hopeless. - Shall we have another game, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.24,0:30:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如何？- 好 再赌一局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Same stake? - Yes, I'll have another go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.91,0:30:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的好运总会用完的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your luck's got to run out some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能一起喝一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.00,0:30:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏富比拍卖会 五十万镑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sotheby's. Half a million pounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.67,0:30:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就是拍卖会上那个人 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The man at the auction. - Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.51,0:30:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对脸孔的记忆不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a good memory for faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.18,0:30:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有身材\N{\fnArial\fs30}And figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.60,0:30:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一定不是巧合 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This can't be a coincidence. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.02,0:30:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要喝些什么？- 不 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What will you have? - Nothing, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.60,0:30:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许下一次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some other time, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.52,0:30:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.36,0:30:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,六点和一点 应该赢定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six and one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.12,0:30:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战果如何？- 看来上校似乎会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - Looks like the Major has got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.29,0:31:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 何不玩更刺激点？加注至十万卢比如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we make it interesting, Major? Double to 100, 000 rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.80,0:31:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法接受 你运气太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't accept. Not with your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.89,0:31:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.72,0:31:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作我就会接受赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have taken that double, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.98,0:31:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不接替上校的位子 贵姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you take over the Major's position? Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.81,0:31:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.73,0:31:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德 谢谢你 我非常乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond. Thank you, I'd be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注是十万卢比\N{\fnArial\fs30}100, 000 rupees, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.41,0:31:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,六六大顺 毕竟这不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double six.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.33,0:31:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个容易被接受的六六大顺 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not such a good double to accept, after all, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.26,0:31:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我再加倍 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Double. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.26,0:31:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要掷一对六点才能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can only win with a double six.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.01,0:31:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注是二十万卢比 你有现金吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stake is 200, 000 rupees. Do you have the cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.94,0:32:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这个应该就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think that this should be ample security.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.44,0:32:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请开始 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.62,0:32:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要十足的好运气才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need a great deal of luck to get out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.29,0:32:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 好运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.21,0:32:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我应该沾玩家的光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I shall use player's privilege,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.21,0:32:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,借用你的骰子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and use your lucky dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.30,0:32:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,全凭手腕功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all in the wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.14,0:32:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,六六大顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double sixes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.64,0:32:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.89,0:32:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十万卢比\N{\fnArial\fs30}200, 000 rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.66,0:32:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.16,0:33:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兑换现金给他 - 是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get it cashed for him. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.75,0:33:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 快把钱花完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend the money quickly, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正有此意 卡马汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to, Kamal Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.68,0:33:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的保障\N{\fnArial\fs30}My security.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.35,0:33:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.70,0:33:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不全然是手腕的功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not really in the wrist, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.96,0:33:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我跟踪他们吗？- 你是应该…不过我认为他们会跟着这个来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should I be following them? - Yes, but I think they'll be following this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.13,0:33:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.55,0:34:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,维杰会从此接手 我留下来继续查他的底细\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vijay will take you from here. I'll see if I can find out more about Kamal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.30,0:34:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 拿一下好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Hold on to these, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.14,0:34:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,够你买好几个礼拜咖喱 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep you in curry for a few weeks, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.14,0:34:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 这笔不义之财真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. It's a wonderful racket, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维杰 我们有伴了 - 没问题 这是公司的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vijay, we have company. - No problem. This is a company car.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.95,0:35:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲上去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.03,0:35:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该能把他们甩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should shake 'em off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.45,0:35:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏这笔现款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God for hard currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.42,0:35:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,球赛结束 坐稳了 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game, set and match. Hang on, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.53,0:36:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,头低下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.91,0:36:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.66,0:37:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚下我的床
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.79,0:37:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.17,0:37:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,借用一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.60,0:37:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你最好自己把这吞回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. You'd better stick this back yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.44,0:37:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！在这里 快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, over here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.46,0:38:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,维杰 我给你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vijay. The money I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.30,0:38:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去 钞票…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Rupees!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.14,0:38:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得容易花得也快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy come, easy go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.91,0:38:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这广告还真派上用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pays to advertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.58,0:38:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.18,0:38:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 Q！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.10,0:39:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 007 都是你 我很不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you? - Most unhappy, 007, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.44,0:39:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要如何维持 工作上的高品质？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I be expected to maintain the quality of my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.61,0:39:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一接获命令就要立刻赶来 没有适合的设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent out here at a moment's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.53,0:39:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会刚好有细一点的线吧？有人把我的西装刺破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any smaller thread? Someone stuck a knife in my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.86,0:39:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没刺中 真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity they missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.45,0:39:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 麻烦你 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, see to that, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.12,0:39:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把PPK手枪也弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've also mislaid my PPK.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.54,0:39:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有吗？- 没了 就这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything else? - No, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.05,0:39:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.63,0:39:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 你无法让它挺举吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having problems keeping it up, Q?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.89,0:39:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在实验阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experimental model.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.14,0:39:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史密特 你好 - 指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Smithers. - Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.86,0:39:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了不起 Q - 来 我有几样东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smashing, Q. - Come on. I have a few things for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.15,0:39:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密特 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice, Smithers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.24,0:39:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 追踪器好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the homing device ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.58,0:40:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是追踪器 还有一具精密的麦克风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only a homing device, but an extremely delicate microphone as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.71,0:40:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样放进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes in there like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.34,0:40:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一支钢笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, take a fountain pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.09,0:40:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,转动一下笔套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twist the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.84,0:40:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,内含高浓度的王水\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a highly concentrated mixture of nitric and hydrochloric acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.60,0:40:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能够溶解所有金属 - 非常适合用来毒死作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dissolves all metals. - Wonderful for poison-pen letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.93,0:40:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 专心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay attention, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.52,0:40:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,将顶端拔下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the top off the pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.69,0:40:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个高灵敏度的耳机 可以收听窃听器的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this ultrasensitive earpiece, you can listen in on the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.86,0:40:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个追踪器正好…与你手表上的无线电测向仪匹配\N{\fnArial\fs30}The homing device is compatible with the radio directional finder in your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.45,0:40:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还没有丢掉的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you haven't lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.37,0:40:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 好惊人 它真的有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's amazing, Q. It does work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.75,0:40:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.05,0:40:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最新型的液晶电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the latest liquid-crystal TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.64,0:41:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真灵巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.40,0:41:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 好美的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect image, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.24,0:41:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 你真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.32,0:41:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没时间陪你玩幼稚的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I haven't time for these adolescent antics.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.66,0:41:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指挥官 我们尽力了 - 非常好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the best we can do. - It's beautiful. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.91,0:41:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧 去办你的事 我还有事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get along. I've got my work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.50,0:41:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Q 我来帮你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll give you a hand, Q. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.79,0:41:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.67,0:41:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 维杰 别让他教坏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him teach you any of his bad habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.11,0:41:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你的位子准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond, your table is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.94,0:41:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我并没有订位 - 你的客人在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't reserve one. - Your guest is waiting, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.61,0:42:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.12,0:42:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.45,0:42:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变心意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很高兴 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm glad. - Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.71,0:42:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's put it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.21,0:42:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止 你是卡马汗的朋友中最不具危险性而且最漂亮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, you are the least lethal and by far the prettiest of Kamal's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.38,0:42:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.39,0:42:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他有所提议还是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does he have a proposition for me, or do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.98,0:42:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提出一项交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}He suggests a trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.31,0:42:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,用珠宝蛋换你的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The egg for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.57,0:42:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说珠宝蛋的价格已飙涨 但这不是贵了一点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd heard the price of eggs was going up, but isn't that a little high?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.82,0:42:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,记帐入几号房？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charge it to Room…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.99,0:42:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 27号房 我想还有香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, 27. Along with the champagne, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.37,0:42:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留在接待处好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave it at the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.58,0:42:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.58,0:42:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？卡马汗已经忘了我的长相？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Has Kamal forgotten what I look like already?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.42,0:42:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我自己要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.63,0:43:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来 万一我突然死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that if I depart this world suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.09,0:43:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就有照片可以怀念我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll have something to remember me by?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.14,0:43:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.52,0:43:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保存在剪贴簿里 我收集回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for my scrapbook. I collect memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.69,0:43:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就来制造些回忆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get on with making a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.97,0:43:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还再要一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need refilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.56,0:43:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.65,0:44:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再去拿一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.07,0:44:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 来个交杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother. We'll make yours a loving cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.99,0:44:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.24,0:44:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我的好奇 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive my curiosity, but what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.00,0:44:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的小章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my little octopussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.40,0:45:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.31,0:45:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.40,0:45:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吵醒你 既然你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to wake you. But since you're up,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.07,0:45:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以好好的说再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can say a proper goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.08,0:45:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.09,0:45:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,风景真美 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful view, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.01,0:45:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知如何说再见 - 坐而言不如起而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know how to say goodbye. - Actions speak louder than words.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.27,0:45:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.63,0:46:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}In. Out. In. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.31,0:46:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩们 划快点 一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls. In. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.07,0:46:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,收桨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check oars.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.97,0:48:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,珠宝蛋已失而复得\N{\fnArial\fs30}The egg has been recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.48,0:48:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该感到高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.31,0:48:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一被偷走后…我就很不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not pleased it was stolen in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.98,0:48:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提这窃贼还敢把它带来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor that the thief knows enough to bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.99,0:48:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然他是个冒险家 可能是想勒索我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's obviously an adventurer with possible blackmail on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.49,0:48:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我已经将他抓到我的皇宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I have him as my guest at the Monsoon Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.58,0:48:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快就会招出所知道的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will tell us all he knows very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.25,0:48:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁？- 一个英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is he? - Englishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.92,0:48:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢珠宝蛋 特别偏爱法贝燮的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Likes eggs. Preferably Faberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.76,0:48:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有骰子 尤其是灌铅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dice. Preferably loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.68,0:48:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.76,0:48:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.77,0:48:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很危险 等他一招供就要马上除掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dangerous. After he's talked, we must get rid of him immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.94,0:48:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.28,0:48:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你大概是不会改变心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}A "no" from you has little chance of becoming a "yes".
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.78,0:49:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以谈话到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume, therefore, that the meeting is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.95,0:49:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你犯了一个大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're making a serious mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.87,0:50:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前我还无法抱怨服务品质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so far I can't complain about the valet service.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.04,0:50:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,八点用晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner. 8 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.82,0:51:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生 晚安 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, Mr Bond. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.91,0:51:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,充分休息了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well rested?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.91,0:51:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你与玛格达小姐已见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you and Miss Magda have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.67,0:51:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真是三生有幸 - 你太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was a pleasure. - You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.00,0:51:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意先用餐吗？蛋奶酥可不能再等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind if we start? The souffl? can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.76,0:51:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请恕我在晚餐上冒昧请问\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the risk of appearing to be making light dinner conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.68,0:51:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为何会在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}may I ask exactly why I am here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.44,0:51:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你已寻回珠宝蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, after all, you do have the egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.77,0:51:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但我们并没有全部的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}True. But we don't have all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.36,0:51:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,倘若要争论的话 我不想说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, supposing, for argument's sake, I don't feel like talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.78,0:51:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 你会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.54,0:51:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.95,0:51:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹棍及烙铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumbscrews and hot coals.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.54,0:52:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们的方法比较先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly. We're much more sophisticated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.80,0:52:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戊硫代巴比妥钠？- 太过粗糙 非常不可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sodium Pentothal? - A bit crude. Very unreliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.97,0:52:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比较喜欢番木鳖毒 混合强效迷幻药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We prefer curare with an effective psychedelic compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.22,0:52:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guaranteed results.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.64,0:52:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但会导致脑部永久性伤害 - 不幸的副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But with permanent brain damage. - An unfortunate side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.65,0:52:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的名菜之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our specialities.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.90,0:52:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,馅料酿羊头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuffed sheep's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.91,0:52:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪 但在我被盯着看时 胃口尽失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's odd, but when I'm stared at I seem to lose my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.68,0:53:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.35,0:53:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就明天见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until tomorrow, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.78,0:53:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要道晚安了 - 我倒是可以进去喝杯睡前酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I'll say good night. - I could come in for a nightcap.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.12,0:53:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许改天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some other time, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.79,0:53:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来杯睡前酒吗？不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you'd care for a nightcap? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.94,0:55:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必你航程愉快吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you had a pleasant flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.45,0:56:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来 一切已准备妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you step this way, I think you will find everything is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.15,0:56:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要感谢你们工匠的精湛手艺 卡马汗王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations on the quality of your workmanship, Kamal Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.24,0:56:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 奥洛夫将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, General Orlov.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.99,0:56:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个部分都根据蓝金提供的规格\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, each piece has been meticulously duplicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.33,0:56:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,予以严谨地复制\N{\fnArial\fs30}according to Lenkin's specifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.50,0:56:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！把它放上直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Have it put aboard the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.84,0:57:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能信任他们吗？- 我保证他们会三缄其口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can they be trusted? - I assure you oftheir silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.93,0:57:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两人都下了极大的赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are both playing for enormous stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.69,0:57:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得到我想要的 你得到真的珠宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get what I want, then you get the genuine jewellery.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.69,0:57:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点不错…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.63,0:57:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,精确的时间控制非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}The precise timing will be essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.47,0:57:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住：不可改变计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember: Nothing must be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.98,0:57:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周后的今天 在卡马克斯城\N{\fnArial\fs30}One week from today, in Karl-Marx-Stadt.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.73,0:58:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡马克斯城 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Karl-Marx-Stadt. - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.92,0:58:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都处理好了？- 照你的吩咐办好了 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything taken care of? - As you ordered, Excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.93,0:58:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以 你取回珠宝蛋了 - 从一个窃贼手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, you recovered it? - From an accomplice ofthe thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.85,0:58:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上把他杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be eliminated at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.60,0:58:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准再有安全上的漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be no further security breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.85,0:58:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个膺品已引起不少麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fake has caused enough trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.55,0:58:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.14,0:59:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的表现很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything has been most satisfactory.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.98,0:59:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥洛夫将军 你太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most kind, General Orlov.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.36,0:59:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去杀了邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.88,1:00:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个英国人脱逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Englishman has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.29,1:00:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑不远的 我们会去追踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't go very far. We'll track him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.47,1:01:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.22,1:01:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,运动开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the sport commence.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.10,1:02:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.69,1:02:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.87,1:02:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了！…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.21,1:02:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,围住他！…他在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go round. He's in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.49,1:03:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiss off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.16,1:05:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.12,1:05:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mom, buddy, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.87,1:05:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you all right, buddy? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.21,1:05:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是我们这一团的吗？- 不 女士 我是经济团的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you with our group? - No, ma'am. I'm with the economy tour.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.88,1:05:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生实在是稀有动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond is indeed a very rare breed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.64,1:05:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过马上就要绝种了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon to be made extinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.23,1:06:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,属毒章鱼 它的毒液可在数秒内致人于死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genus Hapalochlaena. Produces a venom that's invariably fatal in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.40,1:06:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,游艇上就有这种旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The barge had that sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.24,1:06:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个住在 水上宫殿的富家女所拥有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to a wealthy woman who lives on the floating palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.16,1:06:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.66,1:06:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道她的真实姓名 大家都叫她「八爪女」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows her real name, but she's known as Octopussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.50,1:06:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在卡马汗那里听过这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the name I heard at Kamal's.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.75,1:06:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说岛上全是美女 不准男人进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear that island's full of beautiful women. No men allowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.25,1:06:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？性别歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Sexual discrimination.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.01,1:06:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要亲自拜访一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll definitely have to pay it a visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.18,1:08:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.69,1:08:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在猜你何时会到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wondered when you might arrive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.94,1:08:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是神秘的八爪女\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are the mysterious Octopussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.78,1:08:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.94,1:08:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 杀人执照\N{\fnArial\fs30}007, licensed to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.53,1:08:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你今晚的目标吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to be your target for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.12,1:08:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.29,1:08:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看你告诉我多少 有关走私珠宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends how much you tell me about jewellery smuggling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.88,1:08:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,及我方情报员 在东柏林被杀的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why one of our agents was killed in East Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.96,1:08:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know nothing about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.96,1:08:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得戴斯特史迈上校吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Major Dexter Smythe?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.80,1:08:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你奉命逮捕他 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were sent out to arrest him, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.05,1:08:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解的真不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to have done your homework.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.39,1:08:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我当然记得 史迈在光荣退伍后便加入我方情报组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Yes. Smythe, after a brilliant military career, joined our secret service.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.40,1:08:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的任务是找回 落入北韩手中的一批中国黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mission was to recover a cache of Chinese gold, seized in North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.40,1:09:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与当地向导双双失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both he and his native guide disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.40,1:09:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金从此也消失无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gold was never found.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.07,1:09:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十年后 你奉命抓他归案\N{\fnArial\fs30}And 20 years later you were sent after him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.33,1:09:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,向导的尸体被人发现 头颅中有来自史迈左轮枪的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guide's body turned up with a bullet still in his skull from Smythe's revolver.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.42,1:09:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在斯里兰卡找到他 劝他面对事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I traced Smythe to Sri Lanka,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.00,1:09:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我逮捕他前 我给他24小时处理私人事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gave him 24 hours to clear up his affairs before I took him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.26,1:09:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他宁可选择自杀 也不愿面对军事审判的耻辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He committed suicide rather than face the disgrace of a court martial.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.59,1:09:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有何关连？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the connection?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.60,1:09:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我父亲 我一直希望命运能让我俩见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my father. I'd hoped fate would bring us together one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.27,1:09:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,替他报仇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To avenge him?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.52,1:09:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 为了感谢你让他光荣地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To thank you for giving him an honourable alternative.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.28,1:09:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.12,1:09:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马汗要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamal Khan to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.29,1:09:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.46,1:10:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真大意 - 我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How careless of you. - I apologise.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.38,1:10:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马汗 见见我的新客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I'd like you to meet my new house guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.30,1:10:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说是这个家族的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old friend of the family, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.89,1:10:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.89,1:10:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你求生存的方式真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a nasty habit of surviving.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.81,1:10:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道适者生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say about the fittest.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.56,1:10:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,八爪女 我会很高兴…能再有一个亲自解决他的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octopussy, I'd enjoy another opportunity to take care of Mr Bond personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.49,1:10:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会处理邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take care of Mr Bond myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.49,1:10:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.08,1:10:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}And enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.42,1:10:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.67,1:10:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲成为章鱼教的权威\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father became a leading authority on octopi.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.01,1:10:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他深爱它们 他暱称我叫八爪女\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved them. His pet name for me was Octopussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.35,1:11:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 走私不关情报局的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond, smuggling is no concern of the secret service.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.52,1:11:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并未触犯英国法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've violated no British law.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.11,1:11:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随时可以离去 但是我希望你能留下来作客几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free to leave, but I'd much prefer if you stayed as my guest for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.61,1:11:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.78,1:11:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,关德琳 带邦德先生到他的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwendoline, show Mr Bond to his room.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.46,1:11:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.63,1:11:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till the morning, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.59,1:11:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midge.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.39,1:11:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好招呼邦德先生 但先加倍他房间的警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extend Mr Bond every courtesy, but double the guard on his quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.00,1:12:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说岛上戒备森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says the island is heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.04,1:12:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想与八爪女为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to make enemies with the woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.07,1:12:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能伤到那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman must not be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.72,1:12:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我父亲的黄金用完后当初在香港替他卖掉黄金的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Father's gold ran out, the people in Hong Kong who'd disposed of it for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.22,1:13:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供我走私钻石的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}offered me a commission to smuggle some diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.56,1:13:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现我是个中好手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discovered I had a talent for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.81,1:13:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就加入这一行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went into business for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.06,1:13:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但我需要一个组织 所以我重建了古老的章鱼教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I needed an organisation, so I revived the old Octopus cult.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.98,1:13:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你又是从哪里 找到这么多美女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then. Where did you recruit all these lovelies?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.24,1:13:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,东南亚有许多这类型的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many of them all over Southeast Asia,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.12,1:13:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻求精神导师及心灵修炼 谁知道到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for a guru, spiritual discipline, who knows what.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.79,1:13:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我训练她们 给她们姐妹情谊的目标 及物质享受的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I train them. Give them a purpose, a sisterhood and a way of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.25,1:13:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 藉由犯罪行为 - 藉由商业行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In crime? - In business.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.00,1:13:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我采多角经营 航运 饭店与巡回马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have diversified into shipping, hotels, carnivals and circuses.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.68,1:13:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还在岛上吗？- 开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he still there? - You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.60,1:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,007在一座美女如云的岛上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}007 on an island populated exclusively by women?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.60,1:13:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到早上是见不到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't see him till dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.02,1:13:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我午夜再来换班 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll relieve you at midnight. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.22,1:14:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.13,1:14:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天要去欧洲洽谈商务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to Europe tomorrow on a business trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.18,1:14:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 我正准备好好享受一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's a pity. I was just beginning to enjoy myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.64,1:14:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你该留下来 我只去一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should stay. I'll only be gone a week.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.48,1:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我回来再讨论未来的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I come back we'll discuss the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.07,1:14:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能保证我还会待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't guarantee that I'll be here when you return.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.90,1:14:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我们是同一类的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James. We're two of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.74,1:14:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你的聪明才智 如果愿意冒险的话绝对能发财\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are vast rewards for a man of your talents willing to take risks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.83,1:14:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不愿被人雇用 - 好一个有原则的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not for hire. - A man of principle.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.92,1:14:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有人悬赏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a price on his head.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.00,1:14:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然是为女皇及国家办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally, you would do it for Queen and country.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.51,1:15:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有国家 也没有人悬赏我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no country, I have no price on my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.18,1:15:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样的人不需要向你这个 受雇的杀手道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to apologise to you, a paid assassin, for what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.86,1:15:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.24,1:15:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.37,1:15:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是同一类的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are two of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.46,1:15:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.08,1:16:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.22,1:17:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.39,1:17:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.52,1:17:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.94,1:18:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不回到床上来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come back to bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.38,1:18:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.02,1:18:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.16,1:18:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.00,1:19:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.82,1:19:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.57,1:19:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.68,1:20:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,维杰怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Vijay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.44,1:20:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现他时他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was alive when I found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.52,1:20:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有没有说什么？- 他只说是卡马汗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he say anything? - Only "It was Kamal's men."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.45,1:21:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也没有问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.71,1:21:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通知M在柏林与我会合 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better signal M to meet me in Berlin. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.38,1:21:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要到卡马克斯城的马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have to go to a circus in Karl-Marx-Stadt.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.43,1:21:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们证实了009被杀时 八爪女的马戏团也在东柏林\N{\fnArial\fs30}We verified the Octopussy Circus was in East Berlin when we lost 009.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.39,1:21:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马克斯城在更东边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karl-Marx-Stadt is further east.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.27,1:21:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥洛夫将军为何要参与犯罪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would General Orlov participate in a jewellery caper?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.49,1:21:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那批珠宝… 请不要介意我的比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the jewellery, sir, I think is, if you'll forgive the analogy,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.57,1:21:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是章鱼触须的一小部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}only the tip of the tentacle.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.08,1:21:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你需要的证明文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the ID you'll need.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.33,1:21:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯摩顿 来自里兹制造商的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Moreton, manufacturer's representative from Leeds.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.54,1:21:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去考察东德的傢俱工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}visiting furniture factories in East Germany.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.00,1:21:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔会带你进入东德 - 包在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Karl will take you in. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.68,1:22:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 记住 全靠你自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, 007, you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.31,1:22:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 长官 我倍感安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir. That's a great comfort.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.24,1:22:23.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（各位已离开美军管制区）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.62,1:23:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,米施卡.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mischka.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.40,1:25:34.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（八爪女国际马戏团）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.67,1:26:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定认识柏屈同志 爱尔米塔什博物馆馆长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you know Comrade Borchoi, the curator of the Hermitage.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.26,1:26:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才从列宁格勒送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just arrived from Leningrad.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.18,1:26:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫之星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Romanov Star.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.69,1:26:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫之星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Romanov Star.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.48,1:27:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们替货车换轨时 你留在这里看守珠宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here with the jewellery while they switch the car to the main track.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.40,1:27:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay, also.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.07,1:28:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,十万吨核爆能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 kiloton yield.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.07,1:28:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,与美国中型核弹的威力无法区分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The effects are indistinguishable from the American medium-yield bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.24,1:28:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆装置 仔细听好 已设定好四小时后引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The detonator, now listen carefully. It is pre-set for a four-hour delay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.58,1:28:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里设定引爆时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set time for the explosion here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.96,1:29:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要启动引爆装置 插入弹体 顺时钟转四分之一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}To activate, insert and twist the lever a quarter-turn clockwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.84,1:29:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆时至少要离开二十英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be at least 20 miles away when it goes off, hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.72,1:30:02.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西德费尔德 美国空军基地）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.91,1:30:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些珠宝在苏黎世 可为我们赚进三亿美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jewellery should net us 300 million in Zich.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.41,1:30:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是得先越过边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have to cross the border.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.34,1:30:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.59,1:30:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au revoir, dear lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.13,1:30:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.45,1:32:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那筒子拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the canister.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.21,1:32:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.55,1:32:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管它了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave that. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.80,1:32:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们留下来 坐在箱子上 双手放在膝盖上 动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stay. Sit on that box. Hands on your knees. Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.31,1:32:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何把核弹装在火车上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that bomb on the train?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.06,1:32:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 英国情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - British secret service.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.82,1:32:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该更担心要如何活着离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be more concerned about getting out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.24,1:32:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更关心美国空军基地内 即将引爆的核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am more concerned about an atomic bomb exploding on a US Air Force base.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.08,1:33:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不是想挑起核战 万一美国报复呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be inviting a nuclear war. What happens when the US retaliates?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.92,1:33:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,向谁报复？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against whom?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.09,1:33:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.51,1:33:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我方的早期预警系统 会排除遭受苏俄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our early-warning system will rule out the bomb having come from Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.10,1:33:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或其他国家攻击的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.26,1:33:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都会误认为…是美国的核弹意外引爆所致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone will assume incorrectly that it was a US bomb triggered accidentally.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.69,1:33:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最合理的解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be the most plausible explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.86,1:33:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲就会实施片面限武裁军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Europe will insist on disarmament,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.61,1:33:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,使别国国境毫无防御措施 让你的军队如入无人之境\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving every border undefended for you to walk across at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.70,1:33:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,成千上万无辜百姓死于非命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter a damn to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.87,1:33:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你是一点关系也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}that thousands of innocent people will die in your accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.62,1:33:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比那些在莫斯科的老政客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than letting a handful of old men in Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.96,1:33:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在谈判中丧失优势要好的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}bargain away our advantage in disarmament talks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.21,1:33:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 站起来 你要去阻止火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet, General. You're going to stop that train.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.30,1:33:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太迟了 - 你可以在边界拦下火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Too late. - You can stop it at the border.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.64,1:34:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.92,1:34:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.85,1:34:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,到火车站去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the station!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.78,1:34:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住那部车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that car!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.48,1:35:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.56,1:35:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着那部车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that car.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.09,1:37:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马汗叫我们留在这里 直到越过边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamal Khan says we are to stay here until we cross the border.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.18,1:37:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奥洛夫将军的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The licence plate is General Orlov's.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.69,1:37:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have discovered this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.44,1:37:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥洛夫将军在哪里？- 据报他正前往边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is General Orlov now? - Last reported heading for the border.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.03,1:39:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要到那列火车上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must get to that train.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.54,1:39:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.47,1:39:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑劣的小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A common thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.64,1:39:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,侮辱了身上的军服\N{\fnArial\fs30}A disgrace to the uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.81,1:39:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是明天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But tomorrow…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.90,1:39:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将成为英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be a hero…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.32,1:39:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联的大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.60,1:40:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是11点45分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now 11:45.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.19,1:40:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,表演在三点开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The performance begins at 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.61,1:40:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,预留表演延迟的时间 核弹设定在3点45分引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allowing for delays, set the bomb to detonate at 3.45.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.05,1:40:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要在 3点15分前离开基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must leave the base by 3.15.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.55,1:40:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们都不会迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it none of you will be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.85,1:43:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看好珠宝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jewellery.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.27,1:43:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认出他是谁吗？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you recognise him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.69,1:43:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.41,1:44:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,车顶上有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the roof. Trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.85,1:44:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,米施卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mischka.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.55,1:45:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一刀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.06,1:45:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我的兄弟报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.98,1:45:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为009报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's for 009.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.83,1:47:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈宾达会看着珠宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gobinda will stay with the jewellery.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.52,1:48:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 失陪一下 我要去安排行程 好好享受表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, excuse me. I have some travel arrangements to make. Enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.11,1:49:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 将军一定会乐死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - I'm sure he'll get a big blast out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.28,1:49:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他不会失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he won't be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.31,1:49:53.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（空军基地）
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.28,1:50:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是邦德 - 很好 让他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was Bond. - Good. Let him keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.70,1:50:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定来不及 顺便连他也一起除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be late and we'll be rid of him too.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.21,1:50:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.30,1:50:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.73,1:50:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真精彩 - 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marvellous. - General…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.90,1:50:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我偷你的皮夹要禁闭多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long would I get in the brig if I stole your wallet?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.98,1:51:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大概两年 - 要这么久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About two years. - That long?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.23,1:51:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此 我最好还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in that case, I'd better return it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.32,1:51:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.22,1:51:11.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费尔德美国空军基地）
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.83,1:51:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指挥官在哪里？这是紧急事件 - 请出示你的马戏团通行证\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the Base Commander? - Let's see your circus pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.42,1:51:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我说过是紧急事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, man, it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.59,1:51:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车 双手举起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out. Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.77,1:51:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 有个疯子开赃车闯了进去 他指名找指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some nut in a red shirt went through in a stolen car. Wants the Base Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.69,1:51:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.61,1:51:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个穿红衬衫的傢伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go after that guy in the red shirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.86,1:51:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind the trailers.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.14,1:52:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿继续找 他一定在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep searching, you guys. He's gotta be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.06,1:52:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖车底下也要搜查 快 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look under the trailer, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.18,1:52:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位女士先生 请注意… - 还有别人在里面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ladies and gentlemen… - Hey. Is anyone else in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.43,1:53:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,本团首度在贵国献艺…挑战死亡极限的人肉炮弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in this country, the death-defying human cannonball.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.02,1:53:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常荣幸向各位介绍…勇敢无畏的法兰西斯柯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the pleasure in presenting to you Francisco the Fearless.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.95,1:53:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人穿了小丑的服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}The suspect's wearing a clown suit. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.46,1:53:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.88,1:53:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 等一下 跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, buddy. You're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.32,1:53:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 将军 大炮里有核弹 - 当然 要不然该放哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- General, there's a bomb in that cannon. - Sure. Where else would a bomb be?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.82,1:53:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老套的小丑把戏 - 我说真的 我是英国情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great clown. - I'm deadly serious. I'm a British agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.16,1:54:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 告诉他我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - For God's sake, tell him who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.16,1:54:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马汗和奥洛夫骗了你 我看见他们把珠宝拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamal and Orlov double-crossed you. I saw them take the jewellery off the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.17,1:54:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that convince you?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.67,1:54:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹设定在3点45分引爆 只剩下90秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, that bomb is set to explode at 3.45. That's 90 seconds from now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.09,1:54:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 他不是醉了就是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, this man's either drunk or crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.19,1:54:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会毁了整个行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll destroy the entire operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.46,1:54:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个快抓住他 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, grab that man. Hold him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.79,1:54:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！快放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.38,1:54:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 那里面有炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go, there's a bomb in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.14,1:55:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.40,1:55:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.50,1:55:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.17,1:55:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢你 你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Great job, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.00,1:55:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡马汗去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was Kamal going?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.26,1:55:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,回印度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to India.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.26,1:55:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位观众 刚才出了点紧急状况 不过已经没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks, we've had an emergency, but everything is all right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.85,1:55:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大家都很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your families are safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.10,1:55:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位依序慢慢出场 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please leave the tent in an orderly manner. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.61,1:56:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞机加好油了 - 我们一早就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The plane is refuelled. - We'll take off at sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.20,1:56:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金卷都装上飞机了吗？- 是的 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are the gold certificates on board? - Yes, Excellence.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.04,1:56:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些也一起带走 美金 英镑 法郎 马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take these also. Dollars, pounds, francs, marks.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.21,1:56:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以自己印钞票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can always print my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.46,1:56:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么声音？- 女孩们在勾引男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - Girls selling themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.55,1:56:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 够他们忙一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. It will keep the men occupied.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.97,1:56:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让他们见到我离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want them to see me leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.90,1:56:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.74,1:56:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.45,1:57:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.64,1:57:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来 - 都摆平了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - All set?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.24,1:58:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.66,1:58:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.26,1:58:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确定马匹都装上马鞍 - 是 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make sure the horses are saddled. - Yes, Excellence.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.26,1:58:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等一下与你会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll join you in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.19,1:58:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的以为逃得掉吗？- 奥洛夫背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you really think you can escape me? - Orlov betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.20,1:58:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓根本不知道核弹的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I knew nothing about the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.20,1:58:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是伙伴 是朋友 八爪女 我绝不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're partners, we're friends. Octopussy, I would never do anything to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.14,1:59:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我与成千上万无辜百姓 一齐被炸死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me to be killed along with thousands of innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.47,1:59:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,八爪女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octopussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.56,1:59:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,八爪女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octopussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.23,1:59:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我要把这带给你 我们能发大财\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I was bringing you this. We can make millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.99,1:59:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下她 她是我们的护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her. She's our ticket out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.43,1:59:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Q 想必你能操纵这玩意儿 - 全靠热气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I trust you can handle this contraption. - It goes by hot air.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.52,2:00:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, then you can.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.95,2:00:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她们似乎已控制住情况 - 我没看见八爪女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're doing fine. - But I don't see Octopussy.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.22,2:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在那里 她有麻烦了 - 把你的臭手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There she is. She's in trouble. - Get your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.97,2:00:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把气球降下去 - 不 上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take her down. - No. Up!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.14,2:00:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？别笨了 007 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? Look, don't be an idiot, 007. Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.74,2:00:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.74,2:02:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.91,2:02:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想干嘛？别闹了 我们没时间瞎搅和 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Cut it out. We haven't time for that. Later perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.11,2:02:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Giddap.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.46,2:03:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.63,2:04:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会害死大家 出去杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll kill us all. Go out and get him.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.30,2:04:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去外面？- 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out there? - Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.80,2:04:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Excellence.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.05,2:06:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了 快跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.41,2:06:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我国政府坚决否认 此一事件曾经发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My government categorically denies the incident ever occurred.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.17,2:06:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 我们要求邦德…归还我国的历史国宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, we request Bond to return one of our most historic treasures…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.67,2:06:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫之星\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Romanov Star.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.51,2:06:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,考量英俄双边关系 我相信这是可以安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the interests of our Anglo-Soviet relationships, that can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.09,2:06:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德指挥官在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Commander Bond?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.26,2:07:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸地 由于他受了重伤 目前仍不适合旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owing to the serious nature of his injuries, he's still not fit enough to travel.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.85,2:07:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一…二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In. Out. In. Out.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.12,2:07:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish… - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.71,2:07:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你的身体不是那么虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you weren't in such a weakened condition.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.63,2:07:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.27,2:07:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James!
